  "theoryOfChange": "UNRWA USA has a published strategic framework titled \"UNRWA USA Vision 2024: Strategic Plan 2021-2023 (Rvsd Oct 2021)\". This document outlines their mission to \"lift up the voices, experiences, and humanity of Palestine refugees to secure American support for resources essential to every human being, for the promise of a better life,\" and their vision for \"a world where Palestine refugees thrive\". The strategic plan details three key objectives: raising $17 million between 2021 and 2023 for programs, establishing a visible and recognized brand for advocacy and fundraising, and strengthening internal systems for effective operations. For each objective, specific activities are listed, such as raising individual giving, increasing grant revenue, refreshing branding, integrating storytelling, and improving internal procedures.",
