      "strengths_deep_dive": [
        "UNRWA USA demonstrates institutional-grade capacity in managing large-scale humanitarian grants. In FY2023, the organization facilitated <cite id=\"9\">$77,738,191 in total grants</cite> to support international operations, primarily focusing on the Gaza Strip and surrounding regions. Their impact is quantifiable through direct service delivery, including the distribution of <cite id=\"10\">57,063 food parcels</cite> and the provision of <cite id=\"11\">100 university scholarships</cite> in a single reporting period. This focus on both immediate survival and future opportunity is supported by a <cite id=\"12\">13-member independent board</cite> that provides rigorous oversight of financial disbursements."
      ],
      "summary": "UNRWA USA serves as a critical lifeline for Palestine refugees, focusing on direct humanitarian aid, education, and healthcare. The organization operates with a high degree of financial efficiency, reporting <cite id=\"1\">a program expense ratio of 93.4%</cite> in FY2024. This ensures that the vast majority of donor contributions directly fund essential services like <cite id=\"2\">food parcels, university scholarships, and mental health support</cite>. In FY2023, the charity managed <cite id=\"3\">$32,433,934 in total revenue</cite>, demonstrating significant scale and the ability to mobilize resources for urgent needs. Their fundraising model is notably lean, spending only <cite id=\"4\">$0.05 to raise every $1</cite>, which exceeds the industry standard for efficiency. Beyond immediate relief, UNRWA USA supports long-term human development by funding <cite id=\"5\">education grants and shelter reconstruction</cite> for displaced families. The organization maintains a <cite id=\"6\">91/100 overall score from Charity Navigator</cite>, reflecting strong accountability and leadership. For Muslim donors, the charity provides a <cite id=\"7\">verified zakat-eligible giving channel</cite> that specifically serves the poor and needy (fuqara and masakin) within the Palestine refugee community. This combination of high financial transparency and direct impact in a high-urgency cause area makes it a leading choice for humanitarian giving.",
